{
    "title": "Poweramp Music Player (Trial)",
    "description": "Poweramp is a powerful music player for Android.\r\n\r\nPoweramp plays local music files in various formats, including Hi-Res formats.\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n===\r\n\u2022 Audio engine:\r\n  \u2022 support for hi-res output (if supported by the device)\r\n  \u2022 custom DSP, including updated Equalizer/Tone/Stereo expand, and the Reverb/Tempo effects\r\n  \u2022 unique DVC (Direct Volume Control) mode allowing powerful equalization/tone control without sound distortion\r\n  \u2022 internal 64bit processing\r\n  \u2022 AutoEq presets\r\n  \u2022 new configurable per-output Options\r\n  \u2022 new configurable Resampler, Dither options\r\n  \u2022 opus, tak, mka, dsd dsf/dff formats support\r\n  \u2022 gapless smoothing\r\n  \u2022 30/50/100 volume levels\r\n\r\n\u2022 UI:\r\n  \u2022 visualizations (.milk presets and spectrum)\r\n  \u2022 synchronized/plain lyrics\r\n  \u2022 Light and Dark skins included, both with Pro Buttons and Static Seekbar options\r\n  \u2022 as previously, 3rd party skins are available\r\n\r\nOther features:\r\n- multiband graphical equalizer for all supported formats, built-in and custom presets. Up to 32 bands supported\r\n- parametric equalizer mode where each band is added and configured separately\r\n- separate powerful Bass/Treble\r\n- stereo eXpansion, mono mixing, balance, tempo control, reverb, system MusicFX (if supported by the device)\r\n- Android Auto\r\n- Chromecast\r\n- m3u/pls http streams\r\n- Direct Volume Control (DVC) for extended dynamic range and really deep bass\r\n- crossfade\r\n- gapless \r\n- replay gain\r\n- plays songs from folders and from own library\r\n- dynamic queue\r\n- lyrics support, including lyrics search via plugin\r\n- embed and standalone .cue files support\r\n- support for m3u, m3u8, pls, wpl playlists, playlist importing and exporting\r\n- downloads missing album art\r\n- artist images downloading\r\n- custom visual themes, skins available on Play\r\n- widgets with an advanced customization\r\n- lock screen options\r\n- Milkdrop compatible visualization support (and 3rd party downloadable visualizations)\r\n- tag editor\r\n- audio info with detailed audio processing information\r\n- high level of customization via settings\r\n\r\n* Android Auto, Chromecast are trademarks of Google LLC.\r\n\r\nThis version is 15 days full featured Trial. See Related Apps for Poweramp Full Version Unlocker or use Buy option in Poweramp settings to buy the Full Version.\r\n\r\nAll Permissions in Details :\r\n\u2022 Modify or delete the contents of your shared storage  -  to read or modify your media files, including playlists, album covers, CUE files, LRC files on the older versions of Androids\r\n\u2022 Foreground Service  - to be able to play music in the background\r\n\u2022 Modify system settings; Disable your screen lock; This app can appear on top of other apps - optional - to enable player on the lock screen\r\n\u2022 Prevent phone from sleeping - to be able to play music in background on old Androids\r\n\u2022 Full network access - to search for covers and play http streams, for Chromecast\r\n\u2022 View network connections - to be able to load covers only via wifi\r\n\u2022 Modify audio settings - to be able to switch audio to speaker\r\n\u2022 Send sticky broadcast - for 3rd party APIs accessing Poweramp\r\n\u2022 Access Bluetooth settings - to be able to get Bluetooth parameters on old Androids\r\n\u2022 Set Volume Key Long Press Listener - optional - to set previous/next track action to volume buttons\r\n\u2022 Control vibration - to enable vibration feedback for headset button presses\r\n\u2022 Allow app to send you notifications - optional - to show the playback notification\r\n\u2022 Allow app to find, connect to, and determine the relative position of nearby devices (Pair with Bluetooth devices; Connect to paired Bluetooth devices) - to be able to get/control Bluetooth output parameters",
    "descriptionHTML": "Poweramp is a powerful music player for Android.<br><br>Poweramp plays local music files in various formats, including Hi-Res formats.<br><br>Features<br>===<br>\u2022 Audio engine:<br>  \u2022 support for hi-res output (if supported by the device)<br>  \u2022 custom DSP, including updated Equalizer/Tone/Stereo expand, and the Reverb/Tempo effects<br>  \u2022 unique DVC (Direct Volume Control) mode allowing powerful equalization/tone control without sound distortion<br>  \u2022 internal 64bit processing<br>  \u2022 AutoEq presets<br>  \u2022 new configurable per-output Options<br>  \u2022 new configurable Resampler, Dither options<br>  \u2022 opus, tak, mka, dsd dsf/dff formats support<br>  \u2022 gapless smoothing<br>  \u2022 30/50/100 volume levels<br><br>\u2022 UI:<br>  \u2022 visualizations (.milk presets and spectrum)<br>  \u2022 synchronized/plain lyrics<br>  \u2022 Light and Dark skins included, both with Pro Buttons and Static Seekbar options<br>  \u2022 as previously, 3rd party skins are available<br><br>Other features:<br>- multiband graphical equalizer for all supported formats, built-in and custom presets. Up to 32 bands supported<br>- parametric equalizer mode where each band is added and configured separately<br>- separate powerful Bass/Treble<br>- stereo eXpansion, mono mixing, balance, tempo control, reverb, system MusicFX (if supported by the device)<br>- Android Auto<br>- Chromecast<br>- m3u/pls http streams<br>- Direct Volume Control (DVC) for extended dynamic range and really deep bass<br>- crossfade<br>- gapless <br>- replay gain<br>- plays songs from folders and from own library<br>- dynamic queue<br>- lyrics support, including lyrics search via plugin<br>- embed and standalone .cue files support<br>- support for m3u, m3u8, pls, wpl playlists, playlist importing and exporting<br>- downloads missing album art<br>- artist images downloading<br>- custom visual themes, skins available on Play<br>- widgets with an advanced customization<br>- lock screen options<br>- Milkdrop compatible visualization support (and 3rd party downloadable visualizations)<br>- tag editor<br>- audio info with detailed audio processing information<br>- high level of customization via settings<br><br>* Android Auto, Chromecast are trademarks of Google LLC.<br><br>This version is 15 days full featured Trial. See Related Apps for Poweramp Full Version Unlocker or use Buy option in Poweramp settings to buy the Full Version.<br><br>All Permissions in Details :<br>\u2022 Modify or delete the contents of your shared storage  -  to read or modify your media files, including playlists, album covers, CUE files, LRC files on the older versions of Androids<br>\u2022 Foreground Service  - to be able to play music in the background<br>\u2022 Modify system settings; Disable your screen lock; This app can appear on top of other apps - optional - to enable player on the lock screen<br>\u2022 Prevent phone from sleeping - to be able to play music in background on old Androids<br>\u2022 Full network access - to search for covers and play http streams, for Chromecast<br>\u2022 View network connections - to be able to load covers only via wifi<br>\u2022 Modify audio settings - to be able to switch audio to speaker<br>\u2022 Send sticky broadcast - for 3rd party APIs accessing Poweramp<br>\u2022 Access Bluetooth settings - to be able to get Bluetooth parameters on old Androids<br>\u2022 Set Volume Key Long Press Listener - optional - to set previous/next track action to volume buttons<br>\u2022 Control vibration - to enable vibration feedback for headset button presses<br>\u2022 Allow app to send you notifications - optional - to show the playback notification<br>\u2022 Allow app to find, connect to, and determine the relative position of nearby devices (Pair with Bluetooth devices; Connect to paired Bluetooth devices) - to be able to get/control Bluetooth output parameters",
